      "content": "hey, we're 48 hours out from the v2.4 push. vp is breathing down my neck about hitting this Q4 window, so we really can't afford any last-minute blockers or delays. can you do a final high-level risk assessment on the auth module? just need to know if we're green to merge or if there's anything major that's gonna blow up the launch.",
