    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"edge-case handling in... high-load scenarios\" sounds a bit vague. be real with me—is there an actual bug there or are you just being cautious? i don't want to stall the release for a ghost, but i also don't want to be the one explaining why the auth service crashed on launch day. give it to me straight: is there a specific issue i need to worry about?",
